                {
                  "text": "is going to"
                },
                {
                  "text": "paints"
                }
              ],
              "answer": 1,
              "why": {
                "en": "He planned it before and bought paint: going to.",
                "hi": "पहले से योजना थी, पेंट भी ख़रीदा: going to।"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "say",
          "mode": "answer",
